# What the build context must not carry. Not a tidiness measure: the host's
# node_modules is a pnpm tree full of absolute symlinks into a store that does
# not exist in the image, so copying it in produces a build that resolves to
# nothing. The images install their own.
#
# Patterns are deliberately not root-anchored, for the same reason .gitignore's
# are not: this is a workspace, and node_modules and .next exist under apps/*
# and packages/* as well as at the root.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Never in an image. .env.example is the tracked template and stays.
.env
.env*.local

# The dev SSH keypair the runner presents to the sshd fixture, and the fixture
# itself. Neither belongs in a production image.
infra/sshd/keys/
infra/terraform/

.git/
.github/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.vitest/
docs/
e2e/
*.md
